# IliaGPT - Environment Variables

## Required Variables

```bash
# Database (REQUIRED)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname

# Session (REQUIRED)
SESSION_SECRET=your-secret-key-min-32-chars

# Base URL
BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000
```

## LLM Providers (at least one required for chat)

```bash
# xAI (Grok) - Recommended primary
XAI_API_KEY=xai-...

# Google Gemini - Recommended fallback
GEMINI_API_KEY=AIza...

# OpenAI (optional)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Anthropic (optional)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-latest

# DeepSeek (optional, OpenAI-compatible)
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat
# If DeepSeek changes their base URL, override it here:
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
```

## Authentication

```bash
# Google OAuth
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=...apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=GOCSPX-...

# Microsoft OAuth (optional)
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_ID=
MICROSOFT_CLIENT_SECRET=
MICROSOFT_TENANT_ID=

# Auth0 (optional)
AUTH0_DOMAIN=
AUTH0_CLIENT_ID=
AUTH0_CLIENT_SECRET=
```

## Email (optional)

```bash
# Resend
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# SMTP (alternative)
EMAIL_SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
EMAIL_SMTP_PORT=587
EMAIL_SMTP_USER=
EMAIL_SMTP_PASS=
EMAIL_FROM=noreply@example.com
```

## Admin

```bash
# Used for admin access + billing support emails
ADMIN_EMAIL=carrerajorge874@gmail.com
# Recommended: >= 12 chars (required: >= 8 chars)
ADMIN_PASSWORD=secure-password-min-12-chars

# Required in production when OAuth is enabled (encrypts stored OAuth tokens)
TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=replace-with-32+chars-random-string

# Optional hardening
ADMIN_REQUIRE_2FA=false
```

## Seed/Bootstrap Flags (dangerous)

```bash
# Enable seeding on server start (production seeds always run; in development use this flag)
SEED_ON_START=false

# Hide and disable catalog seed endpoints unless explicitly enabled
ALLOW_CATALOG_SEEDING=false

# Hide and disable Stripe product seeding unless explicitly enabled
ALLOW_STRIPE_PRODUCT_SEEDING=false
```

## Database Pool

```bash
DB_POOL_MAX=20
DB_POOL_MIN=2
```

## Optional Services

```bash
# Knowledge Base (MeiliSearch - optional)
MEILI_URL=http://localhost:7700
MEILI_API_KEY=
KNOWLEDGE_CONTEXT_ENABLED=true
KNOWLEDGE_INGEST_ENABLED=true
KNOWLEDGE_INGEST_WEB=true

# Twilio for SMS
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_PHONE_NUMBER=

# Stripe for payments
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# Redis for caching (optional, falls back to memory)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Figma OAuth (optional; enables Figma integrations)
FIGMA_CLIENT_ID=
FIGMA_CLIENT_SECRET=

# Anonymous token signing (optional; a random secret is generated at boot if unset)
ANON_TOKEN_SECRET=
```

## Channels (Telegram / WhatsApp Cloud)

```bash
# Telegram Bot (webhook)
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET_TOKEN=
# Optional: auto-register the webhook on boot (calls Telegram setWebhook)
TELEGRAM_AUTO_SET_WEBHOOK=false
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-domain.example/webhooks/telegram

# WhatsApp Cloud API (Meta)
WHATSAPP_VERIFY_TOKEN=
# Meta App Secret (enables X-Hub-Signature-256 verification)
WHATSAPP_APP_SECRET=
# Default access token for sending messages (optional if you store tokens per integration account)
WHATSAPP_CLOUD_ACCESS_TOKEN=
# Optional: route inbound messages to this userId when no matching integration account is found
WHATSAPP_CLOUD_DEFAULT_USER_ID=

# Channel ingest mode: auto | queue | inprocess
CHANNEL_INGEST_MODE=auto
```

## Academic Search (optional)

```bash
# Scopus (Elsevier) - requires API key and may require institutional access
SCOPUS_API_KEY=

# Web of Science (Clarivate) - requires API key/subscription
WOS_API_KEY=

# PubMed eUtils (optional key for higher rate limits)
PUBMED_API_KEY=
PUBMED_EMAIL=contact@example.com

# Redalyc (optional token; works with limited web fallback without it)
REDALYC_API_TOKEN=
```

## Development

```bash
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=5000
DEBUG=true
LOG_LEVEL=debug

# Execution intent guard + audit mode
# Modes: off | monitor | enforce
SYSTEM_AUDIT_MODE=true
EXECUTION_INTENT_GUARD_MODE=enforce

# OpenTelemetry
OTEL_SERVICE_NAME=iliagpt-server
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT=
OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_HEADERS=

# Monitoring (Prometheus + InfluxDB UI)
# Set METRICS_PUBLIC=true if Prometheus needs to scrape /metrics directly.
METRICS_PUBLIC=true
PROMETHEUS_PORT=9090
INFLUXDB_ORG=iliagpt
INFLUXDB_BUCKET=iliagpt
INFLUXDB_USERNAME=admin
INFLUXDB_PASSWORD=your-strong-password
# INFLUXDB_ADMIN_TOKEN is the preferred variable. INFLUX_TOKEN is kept as legacy fallback.
INFLUX_TOKEN=replace-with-legacy-or-migrated-token
INFLUXDB_ADMIN_TOKEN=replace-with-long-random-token
INFLUXDB_PORT=8086
```

## Production

```bash
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=5001
LOG_LEVEL=info
```

## Notes

1. **LLM Keys**: At least one of XAI_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY (or GOOGLE_API_KEY), OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, or DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is required for chat functionality.
2. **Database**: PostgreSQL is required. The app will fail to start without DATABASE_URL.
3. **Session**: SESSION_SECRET should be a random string of at least 32 characters.
4. **OAuth**: Google OAuth requires authorized redirect URI: `https://yourdomain.com/api/auth/google/callback`
